Package: rebelrebel
Type: Package
Title: Fast Maps on 'MapLibre' for Marine Data
Version: 2026.11.10.2
Authors@R: c(
  person("Einar", "Hjörleifsson", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "einar.hjorleifsson@gmail.com")
  )
Maintainer: Einar Hjörleifsson <einar.hjorleifsson@gmail.com>
Description: Interactive maps of parquet files and 'DuckDB' tables, drawn in the
    browser by 'MapLibre GL JS': vessel tracks, survey stations, gridded effort,
    depth, relief and contours. The data stay in 'DuckDB' and reach the page as
    vector tiles, so a map of millions of rows stays fast and its colours,
    filters and legend change in the page. A map is served from R on the
    local machine, or written as a folder that opens from its 'index.html'
    with no R and no network but the base map's. Moved from the R package
    'ramb', whose map viewer it was.
License: GPL (>= 3)
